    title: "L4 corpus coverage for receiver-typing work: kotlin and objc have NO repo on disk, swift and scala one each (VernissageServer, docspell); INV-linub's measure-through-L4 rule and WI-lalot's row admission cannot run for four of nine languages"  # 15f2
